- [OrganizerUiState.kt](file:///C:/Users/Takafumi%20Kizuki/AndroidStudioProjects/ImageViewOrganizer/app/src/main/java/com/hazuki/imageorganizer/viewmodel/OrganizerUiState.kt): データ構造の定義（秒数設定・一時停止フラグ）
